msgstr "Use \"Test connection\" to check Evolution is reachable. If the line is not connected, press \"Connect with QR\" and scan it with the phone."

msgid "\"Webhook'u kur\" düğmesine basın. Gelen mesajlar, telefondan ve Flux Certificates'dan gönderilenler canlı olarak buraya düşer."
msgstr "Press \"Set up webhook\". Incoming messages, and messages sent from the phone or Flux Certificates, will appear here live."

